000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. SUPPR1.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO "suppr1.txt"
000070         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000080     SELECT READ-BACK ASSIGN TO "suppr1.txt"
000090         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000100 DATA DIVISION.
000110 FILE SECTION.
000120 FD  REPORT-FILE REPORT IS TEAM-REPORT.
000130 FD  READ-BACK.
000140 01  PRINTED-LINE         PIC X(40).
