000330         10  COLUMN 14 PIC ZZ9   SUM WS-POINTS.
000340 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000350 DECLARATIVES.
000360 BEFORE-TOTAL SECTION.
000370     USE BEFORE REPORTING TEAM-TOTAL.
000380 BEFORE-TOTAL-PARA.
000390     IF WS-TEAM = "SOLO"
000400         SUPPRESS PRINTING
000410     END-IF.
000420 END DECLARATIVES.
000430 MAIN-LOGIC SECTION.
000440 MAIN-PARA.
000450     OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE
